  "title": "Eruption at Mayon — Landsat 8 captures Philippines volcano",
  "url": "https://science.nasa.gov/earth/earth-observatory/eruption-at-mayon/",
  "snippet": "NASA Earth Observatory reports on the ongoing eruption at Mayon Volcano in the Philippines, captured by Landsat 8 OLI and TIRS sensors. The eruption, ongoing since January 2026, shows active lava flows and pyroclastic activity. PHIVOLCS maintains high alert level. Before/after imagery available comparing pre-eruption and current states.",
